ext-3xl lg:text-[40px] leading-tight text-center text-primary-blue">Comprehensive RF Mapping Layers</h2><p class="mt-3 font-normal lg:text-[14px] max-w-full lg:max-w-[70%] xl:max-w-[80%] 2xl:max-w-[70%] leading-[19.7px] text-center mx-auto text-gray-600">Structured datasets engineered to support precise wireless network design, validation, and deployment modeling across technologies and geographies.</p></div><section class="py-4 lg:pt-8 lg:pb-14 overflow-hidden"><div class="container mx-auto "><div class=" grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-center py-2 md:py-8"><div class="lg:order-1 order-2" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(60px)"><h3 class="text-3xl font-light text-primary-blue">High Resolution</h3><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">US 5m hybrid clutter and 10m terrain datasets support refined propagation modeling and improved prediction reliability.</p><ul class="mt-6 pl-5 space-y-3 text-gray-600 text-sm"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-[7px] w-[6px] h-[6px] shrink-0 bg-primary-orange rounded-full"></span><div class="flex-1">5m hybrid clutter provides detailed land use classification for improved building and vegetation loss modeling.</div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-[7px] w-[6px] h-[6px] shrink-0 bg-primary-orange rounded-full"></span><div class="flex-1">10m terrain resolution strengthens path profiling, diffraction calculations, and line of sight validation.</div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-[7px] w-[6px] h-[6px] shrink-0 bg-primary-orange rounded-full"></span><div class="flex-1">Improves signal level prediction accuracy across dense urban cores and irregular topography.</div></li></ul><div class="mt-8"><button type="button" class="
    inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer
    rounded-md
    
    
