l p-6 transition-all duration-300 border bg-primary-blue/30 border-primary-blue/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)"><div class="flex justify-between items-center w-full"><div class="flex-1 pr-4"><h4 class="font-light text-[18px] leading-none tracking-tight mb-2 text-white">LTE by EDX Wireless</h4><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-white">Elevate Your LTE Network Planning</p></div><span class="text-xl flex-shrink-0 text-white">→</span></div></div><div class="cursor-pointer rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 border bg-primary-blue/30 border-primary-blue/20" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)"><div class="flex justify-between items-center w-full"><div class="flex-1 pr-4"><h4 class="font-light text-[18px] leading-none tracking-tight mb-2 text-white">CBRS by EDX Wireless</h4><p class="font-normal text-[14px] leading-[140%] tracking-normal text-white">Comprehensive Network Planning for CBRS Deployments</p></div><span class="text-xl flex-shrink-0 text-white">→</span></div></div></div><div class=" hidden lg:block lg:border-l border-white/20 lg:pl-10 lg:order-2"><div class="overflow-hidden relative w-full"><div class="w-full" style="opacity:1;transform:translateX(50px)"><h3 class="text-[32px] font-light leading-[120%] tracking-normal mb-6" style="font-family:Inter, sans-serif">Wi-Fi by EDX Wireless</h3><img src="https://cdn.foxsuite.ai/media/sumit_royfdfdd%28699e%29/edx%28699e%29/sites/case_studies/wi-fi-by-edx-wireless.png" title="Wi-Fi by EDX Wireless" alt="Wi-Fi by EDX Wireless" class="rounded-2xl mb-6 w-full aspect-[16/10] object-cover"/><p class="font-light text-[14px] leading-[160%] tracking-normal text-gray-300">Wi-Fi, built on the robust SignalPro platform by EDX Wireless, is the ideal tool for planning, designing,  and optimizing Wi-Fi networks, including Wi-Fi 6 and Wi-Fi 7. It supports the latest 802.11 standards  and provides advanced capabilities to address the challenges of real-world RF environments... <button class="text-white hover:underline font-semibold cursor-pointer inline-block ml-1">Read more →</button></p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div id="semiBanner"><section class="lg:py-5 xl:py-10 my-8 container mx-auto"><div class="relative flex w-full h-[350px] md:h-[300px] lg:h-[350px] xl:h-[400px] 2xl:h-[450px] rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden bg-[#2660DF]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-start"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 px-6 md:px-0 md:pl-6 lg:pl-6 xl:pl-10 2xl:pl-16 w-full max-w-sm md:max-w-xl lg:max-w-md xl:max-w-lg 2xl:max-w-2xl items-start text-left"><h4 class="text-sm leading-none tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[rgb(var(--bg-color))] mx-0 text-start"> </h4><h3 class="font-light text-[28px] md:text-[36px] lg:text-[30px] 2xl:text-[36px] leading-tight md:leading-none tracking-tight text-white text-left">Map Data Technical Brief</h3><p class="text-white text-left text-sm lg:text-base xl:text-base 2xl:text-lg font-light leading-6 lg:mt-4 tracking-wider">Review detailed specifications covering dataset resolution, terrain and clutter formats, service area purchasing, Map Sy.</p><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center md:justify-start gap-4 lg:gap-6 w-full md:w-auto"><button type="button" class="
